msgstr "- 保持總結簡潔，但包含關鍵決策、約束和待辦事項。\n"

#: src/uagent/core.py:1931
msgid "- Output should be directly usable as a system message."
msgstr "- 輸出應能直接用作系統訊息。"

#: src/uagent/core.py:1934
